0019:     - The remaining corner tile is a solid non-background placeholder color.
0020: 
0021:     Rule
0022:     - Read the three source masks from the corner tiles.
0023:     - Generate the four rotations of that mask family.
0024:     - Output the unique rotated mask that is not one of the three source masks, using the source color on the background.
0025: 
0026:     Key insight
0027:     The placeholder marks the missing fourth member of a rotation set; the answer is that absent tile, not the placeholder itself.
0028:     """
